Amagi Media Labs Limited TAMS V8.0 Implementation (OpenTAMS)
Copyright © 2026 Amagi Media Labs Limited

This repository contains Amagi Media Labs Limited's implementation of the
Time-Addressable Media Store (TAMS) Specification, published by the British
Broadcasting Corporation (BBC), available at <https://github.com/bbc/tams>.

The JSON Schema files under api/schemas/ are derived from that specification at
tag 8.0 (commit b386c43f97f05274d838066c62eb1d9dad351ea6). They are MODIFIED
copies, not an upstream mirror: 17 of the 41 vendored files differ from
upstream, and one file has no upstream counterpart. Every modification is
catalogued in api/schemas/README.md.

By making this implementation publicly available, we aim to support TAMS
interoperability and broader adoption. It provides a practical reference that
users can examine, test, operate, and adapt to their own needs.


